@meeting train.m11.torres-zeke
// Pillar 5 Step 4, M11 tool upkeep: Torres teaching his own routine (when he's the officer on shift). Seat E1.
title: My Friday routine
from: Zeke Torres
gist: Torres showed you tool upkeep at your bench: charge the scanner, clean and re-seal the pipe kit, check the logger.
== lines
torres-zeke: My Friday routine. Every Friday since I was your age.   [gesture]
torres-zeke > you: Scanner on charge. Pipe kit wiped, new seal. Logger, check its clock.
torres-zeke: Look after them and they look after you. Simple as that.
torres-zeke: That scanner of mine you've got? Thirty years of Fridays. Still going.   [laugh]
